          "description": "私有Hook Version(private-hook-version)的生成时间,格式为YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ss.SSSZ,精确到毫秒,UTC时区,即,如1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z。"
        }
      },
      "example": {
